        "comments": "The assembly cjPlePurp2.1 is based on 101x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Chromosome 9 is about 1/3rd of the size of the other autosomes and a potential microchromosome. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 3 (0 - 3.2 Mbp) is unknown.",
